        {
            "title": "The Complex: Expedition | Full Release Info",
            "date": "2025-02-15 20:49:55",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1791580426046135",
            "content": "Hello everyone! I have not been very public about how development is going, but I can assure you it's still coming. And this time in the form of my biggest and most immersive world yet. The reason for the extended development time is because I decided to remake the entire game completely, the reason being that I wasn't exactly proud of the early-access version. Now that that's out of the way, I'd like to kinda announce that the full release is in the later stage of development and should hopefully be out within a month or two.\n\nThank you all for sticking around, it really means the world to me.\n\nStay tuned for more news here - https://discord.gg/kfPdbP5ryd"
        },
